sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Request
    participant G as GPU
    participant L as LPU
    C->>G: Input
    G->>G: Prefill and build KV cache
    G-->>C: First token
    loop Subsequent tokens
        loop Model layers
            G->>G: Decode attention with KV cache
            G->>L: Intermediate activations
            L->>L: FFN or MoE experts
            L-->>G: Result of offloaded component
        end
        G-->>C: Next token
    end
